- * Sensor-->PFE-->DPC-->WB-->CFA-->CC-->GAM-->VHXS-->CSC-->CBHS-->SUB-->RLP-->DMA-->HIS
- *
- * ISC video pipeline integrates the following submodules:
- * PFE: Parallel Front End to sample the camera sensor input stream
